      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
    {
      "id": "hFEgP13k_yh9HD03iwaoV",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 257,
      "y": 907,
      "width": 919.4196166992189,
      "height": 25,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "aG",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1223703747,
      "version": 203,
      "versionNonce": 768860675,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1794077273209,
      "created": 1794077240494,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "En un código lineal, dmin = el peso mínimo de las palabras no nulas (peso = cantidad de 1).",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "En un código lineal, dmin = el peso mínimo de las palabras no nulas (peso = cantidad de 1).",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
    {
      "id": "mJ1sCfcheO2gYYbjGhZFq",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 257,
      "y": 945.5,
      "width": 749.33935546875,
      "height": 75,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "aH",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1633907437,
      "version": 61,
      "versionNonce": 138815853,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1794077271396,
      "created": 1794077270398,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Esto vale porque la suma (XOR) de dos palabras válidas también es válida.\nEntonces la distancia entre dos palabras equivale al peso de otra palabra del\ncódigo.",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Esto vale porque la suma (XOR) de dos palabras válidas también es válida. Entonces la distancia entre dos palabras equivale al peso de otra palabra del código.",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
    {
      "id": "26pQH1ZbvA7U1zQtXz-tE",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 261.4098205566406,
      "y": 1043.5,
      "width": 276.99981689453125,
      "height": 25,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#e03131",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "aI",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 729288173,
      "version": 182,
      "versionNonce": 1837417197,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1794077313028,
      "created": 1794077298924,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Paso a paso con tu ejercicio",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Paso a paso con tu ejercicio",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
    {
      "id": "zGeBqjiQhDHzF2pTFdl7x",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 262.909423828125,
      "y": 1089.5,
      "width": 646.0006103515625,
      "height": 25,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "aJ",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1917440867,
      "version": 151,
      "versionNonce": 1000265677,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1794077306325,
      "created": 1794077298924,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Datos: (14, 4), g(x) = 1 + x + x³ + x⁷ + x⁸ + x¹⁰ (bits 11010001101).",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Datos: (14, 4), g(x) = 1 + x + x³ + x⁷ + x⁸ + x¹⁰ (bits 11010001101).",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
    {
      "id": "zFmHyw2ClL44GZ2zgNKRQ",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 299.62994384765625,
      "y": 1139,
      "width": 778.5595703125,
      "height": 50,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "aK",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 242862157,
      "version": 141,
      "versionNonce": 376005315,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [
        {
          "id": "PqaNqip_uxOOqm6IlgE7C",
          "type": "arrow"
        }
      ],
      "updated": 1794077477976,
      "created": 1794077298925,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "1. Cuántas palabras hay. Con k = 4 bits de información hay 2⁴ = 16 palabras, una\nde ellas nula. Hay que mirar las 15 no nulas.",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "1. Cuántas palabras hay. Con k = 4 bits de información hay 2⁴ = 16 palabras, una de ellas nula. Hay que mirar las 15 no nulas.",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
    {
      "id": "YPF3l_7wreldUV0eOkvUk",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 301,
      "y": 1200.5,
      "width": 799.8194580078125,
      "height": 75,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "aL",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 85946115,
      "version": 162,
      "versionNonce": 1206056803,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [
        {
          "id": "HpXE-wG11t9xGcAWpCArE",
          "type": "arrow"
        }
      ],
      "updated": 1794077625742,
      "created": 1794077298925,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "2. Generar cada palabra. Cada palabra es V(x) = i(x)·g(x), donde i(x) es la\ninformación (los 4 bits). Con g escrita en 14 bits (11010001101000), multiplicar por\nxʲ es correr la cadena j lugares a la derecha, y sumar es XOR.",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "2. Generar cada palabra. Cada palabra es V(x) = i(x)·g(x), donde i(x) es la información (los 4 bits). Con g escrita en 14 bits (11010001101000), multiplicar por xʲ es correr la cadena j lugares a la derecha, y sumar es XOR.",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
