      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "R(x) = 1 + x + x² + x³ + x⁷ + x⁸ + x¹⁰ . Se divide por G(x) (14 bits: 11010001101000 ); \n\nR ⊕ G = 00100000000000 , es decir resto",
