    {
      "id": "VGqSMqzd44HWx6kKTEPlN",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 254.33636409821392,
      "y": 4012.747932541224,
      "width": 945.5806699784038,
      "height": 25,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b1o",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 2094372515,
      "version": 90,
      "versionNonce": 2141315011,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1794081420893,
      "created": 1794081417450,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Si se entrelazan 25 de esos códigos, ¿cuál es la capacidad de corrección en ráfagas?",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Si se entrelazan 25 de esos códigos, ¿cuál es la capacidad de corrección en ráfagas?",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
    {
      "id": "HncPOhWiPwAfAJZVCPPCx",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 228.92974366582376,
      "y": 4071.0573646411585,
      "width": 739.5994873046875,
      "height": 50,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b1p",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 890136131,
      "version": 125,
      "versionNonce": 373981773,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [
        {
          "id": "pIf0DkcWWhQCrF1i6h6xJ",
          "type": "arrow"
        }
      ],
      "updated": 1794081627390,
      "created": 1794081426616,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Sin entrelazar corrige t = 2 errores por palabra de 14 bits. Con L = 25 , una\nráfaga de longitud B se reparte entre los 25 bloques",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Sin entrelazar corrige t = 2 errores por palabra de 14 bits. Con L = 25 , una ráfaga de longitud B se reparte entre los 25 bloques",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
    {
      "id": "eQCnt6xqHj_4GWT3yw6Qq",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 226.44924439824564,
      "y": 4143.5573646411585,
      "width": 744.5604858398438,
      "height": 25,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b1q",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 908350317,
      "version": 124,
      "versionNonce": 35331587,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1794081428699,
      "created": 1794081426617,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "( ⌈B/25⌉ errores por bloque) y hace falta ⌈B/25⌉ ≤ 2 → B ≤ 25·2 = 50 bits.",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "( ⌈B/25⌉ errores por bloque) y hace falta ⌈B/25⌉ ≤ 2 → B ≤ 25·2 = 50 bits.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
    {
      "id": "TCCbrl2_HDA-_Ipw2lzD0",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1073.7962538980319,
      "y": 4143.991696889586,
      "width": 416.3997802734375,
      "height": 25,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b1r",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1884438541,
      "version": 674,
      "versionNonce": 101522861,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [
        {
          "id": "pIf0DkcWWhQCrF1i6h6xJ",
          "type": "arrow"
        },
        {
          "id": "UNjsfsIfx5i_dWvxvPGQ4",
          "type": "arrow"
        }
      ],
      "updated": 1794081659683,
      "created": 1794081610785,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "ráfaga corregible = L · t = 25 · 2 = 50 bits",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "ráfaga corregible = L · t = 25 · 2 = 50 bits",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
    {
      "id": "SnhzSypx7uNMtCEv1YYiY",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 228.98443709824244,
      "y": 4224.013990874319,
      "width": 867.9655829038144,
      "height": 50,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#e03131",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b1s",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 279641411,
      "version": 143,
      "versionNonce": 281523629,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1794081638237,
      "created": 1794081626805,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Si te piden lo inverso (“cuántos códigos entrelazar para corregir una ráfaga de B bits”):\nL = ⌈B/t⌉. Para B = 100 y t = 2: L = 50.",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Si te piden lo inverso (“cuántos códigos entrelazar para corregir una ráfaga de B bits”): L = ⌈B/t⌉. Para B = 100 y t = 2: L = 50.",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
